#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/extension-traits/extending-other-traits.md:6
msgid "Extending Other Traits"
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/extension-traits/extending-other-traits.md:8
msgid ""
"As with types, it may be desirable to **extend foreign traits**. In "
"particular, to attach new methods to _all_ implementors of a given trait."
msgstr ""

